From ef11f5405439ee0a915dc6e5997f830f58c18f13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:58:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Allow moderators to archive published courses

- PUT /api/courses/[id]: staff roles (admin + moderator) can archive any
  course, including published ones and ones with enrolled students.
  Teachers keep the existing cannot_archive restriction.
- CourseFormModal: moderators always see 'Archive only' (unless already
  archived), with a confirm step for published/enrolled courses.
- CourseCard + teacher page: quick Archive button for moderators with
  confirmation (ar/en/es).
- Add courseArchiveRoute.test.js
